cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Leakage-controlled evaluation of conditional ensemble weighting for flow-based network intrusion detection"
message: "If you use this code or the released evidence, please cite the accompanying manuscript and this archive."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/linran-muxue/leakage-controlled-nids-study"
version: "1.2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-16"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility archive for a leakage-controlled multi-dataset study of sample-conditional
  ensemble weighting in flow-based network intrusion detection. Includes the audited data
  pipeline, all training and evaluation scripts, per-row predictions, the ten-seed primary
  experiment, the gate hyper-parameter search, the identifiability and margin-bound analysis,
  and the expert-diversity suite.
keywords:
  - network intrusion detection
  - ensemble learning
  - conditional weighting
  - data leakage
  - reproducibility
